How Hamnix Micro uses them: as DATA.  Nothing here is compiled or linked.  The
drivers are Adder (soc/nrf52/, soc/nrf52840/, boards/feather_nrf52840/);
tests/nrf52/check_regs.py reads these headers and checks every register
address, offset (computed from the struct layouts, which it checks against
the headers' own size comments), bit position, mask, value and interrupt
number the Adder code names.

